---
---
<lem-type Note extends Page>
  title: string = titleOf(self)
  slug: string = self.title
  layout: (Note, html): html
</lem-type>

<lem-fn titleOf(n: Note): string = n.slug />

The link step follows the call, so it sees what the loader would: `title` waits on
`slug`, which waits on `title`. No order could run them, and the message names the
call the read came through.
